<title>UK: BA appoints new brand manager.</title>
<headline>BA appoints new brand manager.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways said on Wednesday that it had appointed Sue Moore as its general manager, brands management, who would take up the job from April.</p>
<p>Moore replaces Hamish Taylor who is joining London &amp; Continental Railways, which operates the Eurostar service between London and continental Europe.</p>
<p>Moore is currently British Airways' head of European strategy. She would be reporting to Martin George, director of marketing.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
